i.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [[DB-326]](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-326)\r\nThis is a master issue tracking tasks to ensure user-visible transaction semantics in YSQL are the same as that of Postgres to the extent theoretically possible (i.e., barring any differences that stem from distributed nature of the database).\r\n\r\nThere are also some tasks/issues that don't exactly fall in the bucket of user-visible transaction semantics but are related to the transactional sub-system.\r\n\r\n### Phase 1 - Miscellaneous items\r\n\r\n- #1199\r\n- #4291\r\n- #1237\r\n- #9467\r\n- #9929\r\n- #2742\r\n- #11760\r\n- #12166\r\n- #11761\r\n- #11571\r\n- #12168\r\n- #12325\r\n- #12184\r\n- #14985\r\n- #14991\r\n\r\n### Phase 2 - READ COMMITTED isolation level (present as a beta feature in 2.14 and 2.15)\r\n\r\n- #13557 (detailed roadmap present in the github issue)\r\n- #15272\r\n\r\n### Phase 3 - Wait queue based pessimistic locking\r\n\r\nThis feature will support pessimistic locking behaviour for all isolation levels (READ COMMITTED will already have a basic implementation of this in Phase 2, this will serve as an optimization for READ COMMITTED isolation level and will get rid of the basic implementation)\r\n\r\n- #5680 (detailed roadmap present in the github issue)\r\n\r\nThis has been asked in different ways:\r\nIssues from @RunningJon - #9465, #9469\r\nIssues from @bllewell - #1985\r\n\r\n### Phase 4 - Possible future enhancements\r\n\r\n- #9517 (Required for SKIP LOCKED in SERIALIZABLE isolation level. Also allows for higher concurrency than coarse table/tablet locks)\r\n- #9518\r\n\r\n[![Analytics](https://yugabyte.appspot.com/UA-104956980-4/issues/5683/better-transaction-conflic-handling?pixel&useReferer)](https://github.com/yugabyte/ga-beacon)\r\n\r\n[DB-326]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-326?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/5683/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/5683/timeline","performed